# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values before running the app.
`.env` is git-ignored and must NEVER be committed.

# JWT signing secret (minimum 32 bytes of random data).
# Generate with: export JWT_SECRET=$(openssl rand -base64 48)
JWT_SECRET=

# Passwords for the development seed accounts (admin / alice).
# Use strong passwords in any non-local environment.
SHOP_SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
SHOP_SEED_CUSTOMER_PASSWORD=
